## Steps

1. Call **Attempt_Chat_Get**(chat_entry_id: "{{ params.chat_id }}", draft_id: "{{ params.draft_id }}")
2. From the response, collect ALL resource IDs from the **Available** sections:
   - `scenarios_ids` — all scenario IDs
   - `personas_ids` — all persona IDs
   - `objectives_ids` — all objective IDs
   - `problem_statements_ids` — all problem statement IDs
   - `questions_ids` — all question IDs
   - `documents_ids` — all document IDs
   - `departments_ids` — all department IDs
   - `images_ids` — all image IDs (if any)
   - `videos_ids` — all video IDs (if any)
   - `options_ids` — all option IDs (if any)
3. Call **Attempt_Chat_Create** with:
   - `attempt_id`: `"{{ params.attempt_id }}"`
   - `chat_id`: `"{{ params.chat_id }}"`
   - `text_enabled`: `true`
   - All the resource IDs collected in step 2
4. Call **Attempt_Group**(group_id: "{{ group_id }}", name: "short descriptive name")

**IMPORTANT:**
- Use `chat_id: "{{ params.chat_id }}"` and `attempt_id: "{{ params.attempt_id }}"` exactly — do NOT substitute the draft_id
- Pass ALL available resource IDs to Attempt_Chat_Create — do not leave them empty
- If a resource section has no Available items, omit that field
